{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/d5b39b42cd71837a920cff44c56951d1.poster.avif?t=1763761446\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/d5b39b42cd71837a920cff44c56951d1.webm?t=1763761446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/d5b39b42cd71837a920cff44c56951d1.mp4?t=1763761446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/6cef03d8ad48abd7d3a94e1a5c2784c2.avif?t=1763761446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras_big/6cef03d8ad48abd7d3a94e1a5c2784c2.avif?t=1763761446 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Build your deck from <strong>5 specialist Factions</strong> and mod them into a synergistic team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf56 Enter a huge mecha and monster-filled galaxy from the award-winning <strong>Battle Chef Brigade</strong> team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Embark on a personalized adventure full of memorable <strong>fully-voiced characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Carefully command your eager pilots to win <strong>tactical 5 vs 5 card battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Second Voice is calling. Will you listen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/89abdf9c828c641e559419ed21b23751.avif?t=1763761446\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/f89b8df55a66f40bc484429040c984b0.avif?t=1763761446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras_big/f89b8df55a66f40bc484429040c984b0.avif?t=1763761446 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, deploy your hand-picked pilots to the Battle Line. Decide who should attack the incoming monsters, shield your Ship, or be swapped out for a fresh Battle Suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you hit every enemy at once with the boisterous Daciana or target the heart of the problem with the analytical Yan? Pilot abilities play off each other, inviting you to try new pilot and mod combinations against ever-evolving foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/8ddc57795596937f525a3cc3b458ab46.avif?t=1763761446\" width=716 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To grow your crew and deck of mecha cards, you'll forge bonds with space pirates, paranormal investigators, starball athletes, and more. Each Faction offers a unique battle style along with their set of eccentric pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/fab7b7913b18999180370d99be715b5b.poster.avif?t=1763761446\" width=622 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/fab7b7913b18999180370d99be715b5b.webm?t=1763761446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/fab7b7913b18999180370d99be715b5b.mp4?t=1763761446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/1d52779ce62149f01a38609d115d8213.avif?t=1763761446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras_big/1d52779ce62149f01a38609d115d8213.avif?t=1763761446 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old-school mecha anime, Battle Suit Aces is about saving the galaxy with your found family using ancient alien superweapons. Enter into the hand-crafted world, filled with thoughtful and stylish characters prepared to dazzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/13fafd117927a6202ad1a496aa96d41e.avif?t=1763761446\" width=616 height=289 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your personalized adventure is determined by the Factions you court, the pilots you befriend, and the dialogue choices you make. From kicking out oceanside oppressors, infiltrating corrupt corporate facilities, attending a Battle Suit gala, competing in starball, and so much more, your journey truly reflects the choices you make in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your crew\u2019s strengths and strategically deploy them in battle. Uncover the rich lives of over 50 fully-voiced characters and learn what makes them tick. Charming, vibrant art reminiscent of your favorite anime comes to life while the orchestral soundtrack welcomes you into the whimsically warm atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/8169000ae0eab58ccebcf1ac98490e3a.avif?t=1763761446\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/6b272dae1fb319055c714978716ee13d.avif?t=1763761446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras_big/6b272dae1fb319055c714978716ee13d.avif?t=1763761446 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Between missions, spend time on your bustling ship. Get to know your endearing crew over a meal, practice card synergies in the Sim Chamber, craft handy Drones, install powerful mods in your favorite cards, upgrade your ship to support your pilots in battle, handle Faction bounties, and plot a course to your next mission.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/b8b0f45e8a8ef7b007be8a3205f45d32.avif?t=1763761446\" width=616 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mod and battle slots are limited, so prepare carefully. You\u2019ll need a varied deck to counter Battle Suit Aces' suite of villains, who have dangerous abilities and synergies of their own. Your unique build and deployment strategy lets you maximize impact and time with your favorite crewmembers. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/8c9a013d41064f09001556da7ceecd86.poster.avif?t=1763761446\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/8c9a013d41064f09001556da7ceecd86.webm?t=1763761446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/8c9a013d41064f09001556da7ceecd86.mp4?t=1763761446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Strawbeary Delights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/2603a4be5154e4de3a183533509921e5775ed44f.jpg"},{"name":"Thicker Than Water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/58f71222886304153e630f602dda1127d5948b40.jpg"},{"name":"Rockstar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/f08a41a4f33aa2d87f242fa89d18791443cb2ecd.jpg"},{"name":"All That Glitters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/ba54056b0805cbc4b8afdee486b74c721543045c.jpg"},{"name":"Lost Souls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/7ee9211ee3b6bc4fb0034e0698762b9b7e2f88cd.jpg"},{"name":"Tourist Trap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/0a4fd085e509a21e7a1efccc7d6e81d4af2cc29f.jpg"},{"name":"Safe Haven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/95836c5857ef2a38f73af6f1f529d2fed5788848.jpg"},{"name":"Everchanging","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/bdb736a569ed0d16ff39bfcb90f2f216c59c1a42.jpg"},{"name":"Flying Colors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/2bcf94e2e27f5f8e5f0fe1c75e05aa5cd8eb6f6a.jpg"},{"name":"You've Got a Friend in Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870530/bd983fdff181bbda174f8bc9a3f9ea403a0dbcfd.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2870530?t=1763761446","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/4e9dcc24ab4f8b5e1a6b93fab4aadf3264b7f3ec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763761446","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/db358f63f39a68dd81f809ff77686f04b0b9487c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763761446","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/db358f63f39a68dd81f809ff77686f04b0b9487c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763761446","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/d5b39b42cd71837a920cff44c56951d1.poster.avif?t=1763761446\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/d5b39b42cd71837a920cff44c56951d1.webm?t=1763761446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/d5b39b42cd71837a920cff44c56951d1.mp4?t=1763761446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/6cef03d8ad48abd7d3a94e1a5c2784c2.avif?t=1763761446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras_big/6cef03d8ad48abd7d3a94e1a5c2784c2.avif?t=1763761446 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Build your deck from <strong>5 specialist Factions</strong> and mod them into a synergistic team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf56 Enter a huge mecha and monster-filled galaxy from the award-winning <strong>Battle Chef Brigade</strong> team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Embark on a personalized adventure full of memorable <strong>fully-voiced characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Carefully command your eager pilots to win <strong>tactical 5 vs 5 card battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Second Voice is calling. Will you listen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/89abdf9c828c641e559419ed21b23751.avif?t=1763761446\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/f89b8df55a66f40bc484429040c984b0.avif?t=1763761446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras_big/f89b8df55a66f40bc484429040c984b0.avif?t=1763761446 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, deploy your hand-picked pilots to the Battle Line. Decide who should attack the incoming monsters, shield your Ship, or be swapped out for a fresh Battle Suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you hit every enemy at once with the boisterous Daciana or target the heart of the problem with the analytical Yan? Pilot abilities play off each other, inviting you to try new pilot and mod combinations against ever-evolving foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/8ddc57795596937f525a3cc3b458ab46.avif?t=1763761446\" width=716 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To grow your crew and deck of mecha cards, you'll forge bonds with space pirates, paranormal investigators, starball athletes, and more. Each Faction offers a unique battle style along with their set of eccentric pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/fab7b7913b18999180370d99be715b5b.poster.avif?t=1763761446\" width=622 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/fab7b7913b18999180370d99be715b5b.webm?t=1763761446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/fab7b7913b18999180370d99be715b5b.mp4?t=1763761446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/1d52779ce62149f01a38609d115d8213.avif?t=1763761446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras_big/1d52779ce62149f01a38609d115d8213.avif?t=1763761446 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old-school mecha anime, Battle Suit Aces is about saving the galaxy with your found family using ancient alien superweapons. Enter into the hand-crafted world, filled with thoughtful and stylish characters prepared to dazzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/13fafd117927a6202ad1a496aa96d41e.avif?t=1763761446\" width=616 height=289 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your personalized adventure is determined by the Factions you court, the pilots you befriend, and the dialogue choices you make. From kicking out oceanside oppressors, infiltrating corrupt corporate facilities, attending a Battle Suit gala, competing in starball, and so much more, your journey truly reflects the choices you make in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your crew\u2019s strengths and strategically deploy them in battle. Uncover the rich lives of over 50 fully-voiced characters and learn what makes them tick. Charming, vibrant art reminiscent of your favorite anime comes to life while the orchestral soundtrack welcomes you into the whimsically warm atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/8169000ae0eab58ccebcf1ac98490e3a.avif?t=1763761446\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/6b272dae1fb319055c714978716ee13d.avif?t=1763761446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras_big/6b272dae1fb319055c714978716ee13d.avif?t=1763761446 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Between missions, spend time on your bustling ship. Get to know your endearing crew over a meal, practice card synergies in the Sim Chamber, craft handy Drones, install powerful mods in your favorite cards, upgrade your ship to support your pilots in battle, handle Faction bounties, and plot a course to your next mission.